{
  "_note": "TikTok-only fork of styles/ig_question_overlay.json. The brand tag sits at y=300 and a fixed Swipe right prompt renders on slide 1. The technical question uses bundled Montserrat Bold, 42px white text, and per-line dark highlight boxes. Its background color can be overridden per post through style_overrides. This file has no caption_below box. The technical question must fit 3 lines at its fixed 42px; shorten wording that wraps further and check that it does not collide with the prompt.",
